  "summary": {
    "as": "Reported to House",
    "asOf": "2026-10-29",
    "date": "2026-11-12T21:26:08Z",
    "text": "Common Sense 250 Act of 2026\n\nThis bill requires the authorized monument honoring Thomas Paine to be located in Area 1 of the National Mall, which is reserved for commemorative works of preeminent historical and lasting significance to the United States. Thomas Paine was a philosopher and writer whose pamphlet, Common Sense, advocated\u00a0for American independence from Great Britain."
  },
